type: software
title: "HollowLock"
abstract: "A post-quantum TLS posture scanner. It runs browser-like and diagnostic TLS 1.3 handshakes against a host and reports whether a hybrid post-quantum key exchange is actually negotiated, with signed, verifiable reports."
